    para('Each distinct span contributes at most one primary error. Orthographic, script, factual and instruction issues are supplementary unless a separate primary category is assigned. The aggregate rate equals 100 times confirmed primary errors divided by all generated words. Prompt-level rates supply the paired Friedman blocks. Bootstrap samples resample prompts with replacement and preserve model pairing. Confidence intervals describe variation across these prompts under fixed labels. They do not include annotation uncertainty or stochastic variation across repeated generations.')
