    para('All three prompt-level medians are zero. The interquartile ranges are 0.000–0.000 for GPT, 0.000–0.575 for Gemini and 0.000–0.437 for Claude. Every bootstrap interval for the median is also 0.000–0.000. This follows from the concentration of zero-count responses. Aggregate rates and the percentage of responses containing an error therefore convey differences that the median alone obscures. A zero count indicates that the evaluation found no confirmed primary span in that response.')
