    para('Difficulty does not show a uniform monotonic increase. Gemini’s rates across Basic, Intermediate, Advanced and Expert prompts are 0.255, 0.250, 0.343 and 0.298. Claude’s corresponding rates are 0.227, 0.177, 0.222 and 0.273. Expert tasks create more raw errors partly because their responses are longer. Normalization changes that interpretation. Each difficulty subgroup contains 40 matched open-ended prompts per group, which supports descriptive comparison but leaves uncertainty for fine distinctions.')
