    para('Appendix B gives 30 distinct error-bearing responses, ten examples per primary category, selected deterministically by blind ID with no repeated response. The selection illustrates categories and does not estimate their prevalence. Observed patterns include case selection, malformed affixes, misattached modifiers and inappropriate technical word choices. Proposed explanations include transfer from English or Russian and lexical uncertainty. Those mechanisms remain hypotheses because the dataset contains outputs rather than model training traces or controlled causal interventions.')
