        'Togmanov, M., et al. (2025). KazMMLU: Evaluating Language Models on Kazakh, Russian, and Regional Knowledge of Kazakhstan. Proceedings of ACL 2025, 14403–14416. https://aclanthology.org/2025.acl-long.701/',
        'Toleu, A., Tolegen, G., & Ualiyeva, I. (2025). Fine-Tuning Large Language Models for Kazakh Text Simplification. Applied Sciences, 15(15), 8344. https://doi.org/10.3390/app15158344',
